OL,3,GNEWSA'Unprecedented wildfires' heaped
OL,4,Apressure on crews
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn "unprecedented number of wildfires"
OL,7,Fled to one of Essex County Fire and
OL,8,FRescue Service's busiest ever summers,
OL,9,Fit has said.
OL,11,FCrews responded to more than 4,200
OL,12,Fincidents across July and August,
OL,13,Fcompared to 3,821 during the same
OL,14,Fmonths in 2025.
OL,16,FLarge-scale emergencies included an
OL,17,Fexplosion in Rettendon, which injured
OL,18,F20 firefighters, and flames twice
OL,19,Fbreaking out at Middlewick Ranges in
OL,20,FColchester.
